Comment:
 This source is the whole Friends of OpenPGP website repository, which
 aggregates works under several licenses (site content, the Hugo theme
 submodule, and vendored third-party libraries such as pdf.js and stripe-php,
 each keeping its own LICENSE file). The stanzas below cover the deployment
 tooling actually shipped by the binary package (the scripts/ and debian/
 directories) ; a full REUSE/DEP-5 audit of the site content is out of scope
 for this packaging.

